                    "message": "> I thought systems collection only contains objects which have\n\"xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.ManagedHost interface.\n\nYeah you are right, currently the multi-host collection only contains objects that specify `xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Decorator.ManagedHost`. I removed the other interface. \n\nBut following the PDI definition for `xyz.openbmc_project.Inventory.Item.System` we might as well update the collection handler to include the interface. I see other functions added to systems_utils, that also specify it."
