                    },
                    "message": "I don't think it's \"all\" right, it should be only the hosts that are managed by this bmc?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 10,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Oliver Brewka",
                        "email": "oliver.brewka@9elements.com",
                        "username": "mox669"
                    },
                    "message": "Just for clarification: ComputerSystem resources not managed by this BMC, are ComputerSystem resources aggregated from satellite bmcs?\n\nIn the multi-host case, this is every ComputerSystem in the collection, because they all implement the ManagedHost interface. \n\nBut technically you are right. I have rephrased the commit message. Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
